<span class="opt">A. 120,000</span>
<span class="opt">B. 156,000</span>
<span class="opt">C. 160,000</span>
<span class="opt">D. 155,008</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 3分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">3</td>
<td>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 三角形：底12cm·高8cm</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="150" viewbox="0 0 180 150" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,100 145,100 35,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polyline fill="none" points="43,10 43,18 35,18" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="35" x2="35" y1="20" y2="100"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="21" y="60">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="14" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="122">b</text></svg></div>
</div>
三角形底長 12 cm，高 8 cm。面積 = ？
        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. 96 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">B. 48 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">C. 40 cm²</span>
<span class="opt">D. 20 cm²</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 3分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
