        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. 直接比較分子，3 &gt; 2，所以 <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span> 較大</span>
<span class="opt">B. 通分後 <span class="f"><span class="n">10</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span> &lt; <span class="f"><span class="n">9</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span>，所以 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 較小</span>
</div>
<div class="mc-opts" style="margin-top:2px;">
<span class="opt">C. 通分後 <span class="f"><span class="n">10</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span> &gt; <span class="f"><span class="n">9</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">15</span></span>，所以 <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> 較大</span>
<span class="opt">D. 兩個分數相等</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 3分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td class="lf-qn">5</td>
<td>
<div style="text-align:center;margin:8px 0;padding:6px;background:#FAFBFC;border:1px solid var(--borderc);border-radius:4px;">
<div style="font-size:10px;color:var(--gray);margin-bottom:4px;">▲ 梯形：注意高≠斜邊！</div>
<div style="display:inline-block;max-width:280px;"><svg height="120" viewbox="0 0 180 120" width="180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="35,80 145,80 120,20 60,20" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><line stroke="#DC2626" stroke-dasharray="6,3" stroke-width="2" x1="60" x2="60" y1="20" y2="80"></line><text fill="#DC2626" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="72" y="50">h</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="102">b₂</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="12" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="90" y="12">b₁</text></svg></div>
</div>
梯形：上底 5 cm，下底 9 cm，斜邊 7 cm，高 4 cm。下列哪項是求面積的正確做法？
        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. (5 + 9 + 7) × 4 ÷ 2</span>
<span class="opt">B. (5 + 9) × 7 ÷ 2</span>
</div>
<div class="mc-opts" style="margin-top:2px;">
<span class="opt">C. (5 + 9) × 4 ÷ 2</span>
<span class="opt">D. 5 × 9 × 4 ÷ 2</span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 3分</span></td>
</tr>
<tr>
