        計算 <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + <span class="fd"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = ？下列哪種計法正確？
        <div class="mc-opts">
<span class="opt">A. <span class="f"><span class="n">1+1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2+3</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span></span>
<span class="opt">B. LCM(2,3)=6 → <span class="f"><span class="n">3</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">5</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></span>
</div>
<div class="mc-opts" style="margin-top:2px;">
<span class="opt">C. 1 + 1 = 2，2 + 3 = 5，答案 = 2<span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">5</span></span></span>
<span class="opt">D. <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">2</span></span> + <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">3</span></span> = <span class="f"><span class="n">2</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">6</span></span></span>
</div>
</td>
<td class="qs"><span class="score-box">___ / 3分</span></td>
</tr>
</table>
